<title>MALAYSIA: U-Wood in talks to buy company stakes.</title>
<headline>U-Wood in talks to buy company stakes.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U-Wood Holdings Bhd said it is in talks to acquire equity interests in a &quot;few companies,&quot; and that it is requesting a further suspension of trading in its shares.</p>
<p>The maker and trader of plywood, blockboard and timber products made the comments in a statement sent to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>It did not provide any details about the acquisition talks, and company officials were not available for comment on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shares of U-Wood last traded at 11.50 ringgit on October 22.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
